# Line endings are part of the test contract, so pin the working tree to LF on
# every platform. Fixtures under tests/fixtures carry byte offsets, and
# scripts/schema-facts.json is compared byte for byte against what the Rust
# types serialize. A Windows checkout with core.autocrlf=true (the GitHub
# Actions default) rewrote both and failed schema_facts_file_is_current.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Auto-detection already treats these as binary; say so anyway so a stray
# 0x0d in the pixel data can never be read as a line ending.
*.png binary
